      "rendered": "Home"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n<div style=\"height:72px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:72px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tania Joseph</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Tania has been working with the firm on a part-time basis for over five years. She is a QuickBooks ProAdvisor and plans to pursue her CPA designation and Trust and Estate Practitioner (TEP) certification, with a long-term goal of specializing in business and personal taxation.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Under Adrian&#8217;s supervision, Tania prepares personal and corporate income tax returns, assists with compilation engagements in CaseWare, and completes year-end bookkeeping in QuickBooks Online and QuickBooks Desktop. She has experience working with clients across a range of industries.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Tania is currently pursuing a Bachelor of Commerce in Accounting at Ontario Tech University, with a minor in Entrepreneurship. She is actively involved in her university&#8217;s Accounting Association, Business and IT Society, and Women in Business Club. She is also completing a Business Tax internship at a Big Four accounting firm, further strengthening her technical skills and exposure to complex tax matters.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-rounded\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"948\" height=\"948\" src=\"https://adrianjosephcpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Tania-photo.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-148\" srcset=\"https://adrianjosephcpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Tania-photo.jpg 948w, https://adrianjosephcpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Tania-photo-300x300.jpg 300w, https://adrianjosephcpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Tania-photo-150x150.jpg 150w, https://adrianjosephcpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Tania-photo-768x768.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 948px) 100vw, 948px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
